Subject: [PATCH] [SW-402] fs1: status: add status update

This patch adds functionality which allows boot rom to log
its progress in status registers which are part of
security block.

Change-Id: I0fdbbd6aad8cd027e131e0c96eb9172fce511783
---

diff --git a/arch/fs1/arc/common.c b/arch/fs1/arc/common.c
index 831e6b6..4d48b14 100644
--- a/arch/fs1/arc/common.c
+++ b/arch/fs1/arc/common.c
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include <fs1_regs.h>
 #include <fs1_reg_map.h>
 #include <fs1_reg_mask.h>
+#include <status.h>
 
